A more promising existing path is to split `out_gate` from the `dim=128` projection: compute left/right on the main stream, launch the independent `out_gate` projection on a side stream, and overlap it with the triangular BMM. I’ll enable this only for larger sequences where there is enough BMM work to hide it.
